.TH "PVSECRET-ADD" "1" "2026-08-11" "s390-tools" "UV\-Secret Manual"
.nh
.ad l
.SH "NAME"
pvsecret-add \- Submit an add\-secret request to the Ultravisor (s390x only)
.SH "SYNOPSIS"
.nf
.fam C
\fBpvsecret\fR \fBadd\fR [OPTIONS] [INPUT]
.fam C
.fi
.SH "DESCRIPTION"
Perform an add\-secret request using a previously generated add\-secret request.
Only available on s390x.
.SH "OPTIONS"
<INPUT>
.RS 4
Specify the request to be sent.
.RE
.PP
\-i, \-\-input <FILE>
.RS 4
Specify the request to be sent.
.RE
.PP
\-f, \-\-force
.RS 4
Force the addition of add\-secret requests.

Add an add\-secret request even if there is already a secret with the same ID in
the secret store.
.RE
.PP
\-h, \-\-help
.RS 4
Print help (see a summary with \fB\-h\fR).
.RE
.SH "SEE ALSO"
\fBpvsecret\fR(1)